# Context memory

Follow `AGENTS.md`. Before editing:

1. Read `.ai-context/RESEARCH.md` (persistent research context) and `.ai-context/CONTEXT.md`.
2. Read `.ai-context/STATE.json` and the newest file in `.ai-context/log/`.
3. If `.ai-context/COMPACTION_TASK.md` exists, complete it first.

After each work unit:

```powershell
powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File tools/ai-context.ps1 log `
  -Agent cursor -Did "<what changed>" -Files "<paths>" -Next "<next step>"
```

Budget: `... ai-context.ps1 status`; at ~100,000 tokens run `... ai-context.ps1 compact`.
Clean slate: `... ai-context.ps1 reset -Yes` keeps `.ai-context/RESEARCH.md` and archives the rest.
